    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Bane</strong> is a fast-paced 2D roguelike shooter with a twist: you play as a mutated plant defending the last piece of your evolution. Swarms of zombie bugs and corrupted animals are coming for it \u2014 and for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Chaos is inevitable, but how you survive it is up to you.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/33ce9bc56d64545dd5453616e4e466ee.poster.avif?t=1755273335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/33ce9bc56d64545dd5453616e4e466ee.webm?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/33ce9bc56d64545dd5453616e4e466ee.mp4?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <strong>Bug Bane</strong> isn\u2019t automated \u2014 it\u2019s earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to aim every shot yourself, weaving through chaos while making snap decisions. Reflexes alone won\u2019t save you, but they\u2019ll keep you alive long enough to improvise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Not your typical roguelike.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/6aee0274f02ace796df229b3f24a27df.poster.avif?t=1755273335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/6aee0274f02ace796df229b3f24a27df.webm?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/6aee0274f02ace796df229b3f24a27df.mp4?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a range of powerful \u2014 and sometimes risky \u2014 items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term upgrades shape your build, while <strong>Mutation Surges</strong> grant instant effects dropped by enemies. You won\u2019t know if it\u2019s a blessing or a curse until you grab it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, remember the icon you saw, and race against time to find \u2014 and break \u2014 the matching chest before it vanishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face chaotic boss fights, mutate to survive, and adapt to the unexpected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In Bug Bane, it\u2019s not about control \u2014 it\u2019s about reaction.</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/a84d0f465b983808b109b9811d34e42c.poster.avif?t=1755273335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/a84d0f465b983808b109b9811d34e42c.webm?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/a84d0f465b983808b109b9811d34e42c.mp4?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt. Aim. Overcome. -Absolute Bug Bane</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Bane</strong> is a fast-paced 2D roguelike shooter with a twist: you play as a mutated plant defending the last piece of your evolution. Swarms of zombie bugs and corrupted animals are coming for it \u2014 and for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Chaos is inevitable, but how you survive it is up to you.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/33ce9bc56d64545dd5453616e4e466ee.poster.avif?t=1755273335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/33ce9bc56d64545dd5453616e4e466ee.webm?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/33ce9bc56d64545dd5453616e4e466ee.mp4?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <strong>Bug Bane</strong> isn\u2019t automated \u2014 it\u2019s earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to aim every shot yourself, weaving through chaos while making snap decisions. Reflexes alone won\u2019t save you, but they\u2019ll keep you alive long enough to improvise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Not your typical roguelike.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/6aee0274f02ace796df229b3f24a27df.poster.avif?t=1755273335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/6aee0274f02ace796df229b3f24a27df.webm?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/6aee0274f02ace796df229b3f24a27df.mp4?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a range of powerful \u2014 and sometimes risky \u2014 items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term upgrades shape your build, while <strong>Mutation Surges</strong> grant instant effects dropped by enemies. You won\u2019t know if it\u2019s a blessing or a curse until you grab it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, remember the icon you saw, and race against time to find \u2014 and break \u2014 the matching chest before it vanishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face chaotic boss fights, mutate to survive, and adapt to the unexpected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In Bug Bane, it\u2019s not about control \u2014 it\u2019s about reaction.</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/a84d0f465b983808b109b9811d34e42c.poster.avif?t=1755273335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/a84d0f465b983808b109b9811d34e42c.webm?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830770/extras/a84d0f465b983808b109b9811d34e42c.mp4?t=1755273335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt. Aim. Overcome. -Absolute Bug Bane</strong></h2>",
